msgid "PayPal Developer Dashboard → Apps & Credentials → eigene App (Sandbox bzw. Live passend zum Modus)."
msgstr "PayPal Developer Dashboard → Apps & Credentials → votre application (Sandbox ou Live selon le mode)."

